description: Delete test files created for the current task after the test command finishes.
alwaysApply: false
---
# Delete task tests after the run

- After the test command for the current task finishes, delete the test files created for that task. Report the command result first, then delete the files in the same turn.
- Delete only files this task added, such as a new `*.spec.ts` or `*.test.ts`. Leave test files that already existed in the repository.
- Do this whether the run passed or failed. Do not leave the new test files for a later cleanup request.
